          "$a = \\dfrac{f(x_2) - f(x_1)}{x_2 - x_1}$",
          "$a = \\dfrac{3 - (-7)}{3 - (-2)}$",
          "$a = \\dfrac{10}{5}$",
          "$a = 2$"
